Changes since v1:
  - arcv.cc is now introduced by this patch (v1 added it in patch 2/5,
    which no longer creates it), so the config.gcc / t-riscv / arcv.o
    plumbing moved here.
  - The riscv_sched_fusion_priority wrapper now lives in riscv-fusion.cc
    and dispatches to arcv_sched_fusion_priority; riscv.cc only defines
    the hook macro.
  - arcv_sched_fusion_priority now returns bool so the generic wrapper
    can fall back to the default priority.
  - Factored the ARC-V load/store mode restriction into
    arcv_pair_fusion_mode_allowed_p and used it from
    riscv_adjacent_memops_p (replacing the inline TARGET_ARCV_FUSION
    check; umbrella flag replaced by TARGET_ARCV_RHX100).
